# A local leftover, not upstream's and not generated by anything in the tree.
# app.pri only references it under !exclude_fw, and every build here sets
# exclude_fw, so it is unused -- and `git add -A` sweeps it into a commit if
# it is not ignored, which is how it got into one.
res/firmwares/res_fw.qrc
